---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
	title={'Audiology Services | Liberty Hearing Center'}
	description={'Audiology services in College Station, TX — what to expect at your visit and how we review results together.'}
	active="services"
	footer="services"
>
<section style="background:var(--surface-blue)">
<div style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:56px clamp(18px,4vw,32px) clamp(42px,8vw,72px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:22px">
<nav style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:9px 20px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--white);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(var(--navy-rgb),.06)">
<a href="/" style="transition:.3s" style-hover="color:var(--gold)">Home</a><span style="color:var(--text-muted)">/</span>
<a href="/services/" style="transition:.3s" style-hover="color:var(--gold)">Services</a><span style="color:var(--text-muted)">/</span>
<span style="color:var(--text-muted)">Audiology Services</span>
</nav>
<h1 style="margin:0;max-width:1000px;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(38px,4.4vw,64px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.045em;text-wrap:balance">Understand your hearing with clear clinical guidance.</h1>
<p style="margin:0;max-width:840px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;text-wrap:pretty">A complete audiology visit helps us understand how you hear, where listening feels difficult, and what support may make everyday communication easier.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:var(--white)">
<div data-stack="2" style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(42px,8vw,72px) clamp(18px,4vw,32px) clamp(51px,8vw,88px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 370px;gap:64px;align-items:start">
<div>
<details open="true" style="margin-bottom:44px;padding:26px 30px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;background:var(--white);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(var(--navy-rgb),.06)">
<summary style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;color:var(--navy);font-size:17px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.01em">Table of contents<span style="flex-shrink:0;display:grid;place-items:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--navy);color:var(--white);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:1">&#8722;</span></summary>
<div style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
<a href="#s1" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;transition:.3s" style-hover="background:var(--surface-blue);color:var(--brand-red)">Why audiology care matters<span style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:13px">01</span></a>
<a href="#s2" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;transition:.3s" style-hover="background:var(--surface-blue);color:var(--brand-red)">What to expect during your visit<span style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:13px">02</span></a>
<a href="#s3" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;transition:.3s" style-hover="background:var(--surface-blue);color:var(--brand-red)">Evaluation may include<span style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:13px">03</span></a>
<a href="#s4" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;transition:.3s" style-hover="background:var(--surface-blue);color:var(--brand-red)">Reviewing your results together<span style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:13px">04</span></a>
<a href="#s5" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;transition:.3s" style-hover="background:var(--surface-blue);color:var(--brand-red)">Personal next steps<span style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:13px">05</span></a>
</div>
</details>
<p style="margin:0 0 40px;max-width:760px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;text-wrap:pretty">Audiology services begin with a thoughtful conversation and a complete picture of your hearing. We take the time to understand your history and your listening goals before any testing starts.</p>
<h2 id="s1" style="margin:0 0 14px;scroll-margin-top:150px;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(28px,2.5vw,36px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.035em">Why audiology care matters</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 40px;max-width:760px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">Hearing changes can be gradual, and a basic screening only tells part of the story. A comprehensive audiology appointment connects clinical information with the places, voices, and routines that matter to you.</p>
<h2 id="s2" style="margin:0 0 14px;scroll-margin-top:150px;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(28px,2.5vw,36px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.035em">What to expect during your visit</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 40px;max-width:760px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">Your appointment may include a review of your listening concerns, a visual ear check, diagnostic testing, and a clear explanation of the results. Our goal is to help you understand what is happening and what options are reasonable.</p>
<h2 id="s3" style="margin:0 0 14px;scroll-margin-top:150px;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(28px,2.5vw,36px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.035em">Evaluation may include</h2>
<ul style="margin:0 0 40px;padding-left:22px;max-width:760px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;line-height:1.7">
<li>Otoscopy and ear health review</li>
<li>Pure-tone threshold testing</li>
<li>Speech understanding measures</li>
<li>Conversation about daily listening goals</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="s4" style="margin:0 0 14px;scroll-margin-top:150px;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(28px,2.5vw,36px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.035em">Reviewing your results together</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 40px;max-width:760px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">We explain your audiogram in plain language and connect the findings to real-world situations. Recommendations might include monitoring, communication strategies, medical referral, hearing technology, or another form of support.</p>
<h2 id="s5" style="margin:0 0 14px;scroll-margin-top:150px;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(28px,2.5vw,36px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.035em">Personal next steps</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 48px;max-width:760px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">Audiology care should feel informative, not rushed. You will leave with clear answers, practical recommendations, and time to decide what feels right for you.</p>
<div data-stack="2" style="padding-top:34px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:26px">
<a href="/services/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:24px 28px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface);transition:.3s" style-hover="background:var(--surface-blue);transform:translateY(-4px)"><span style="color:var(--gold);font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase">All services</span><strong style="color:var(--navy);font-size:18px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.02em">Back to services</strong></a>
<a href="/hearing-aid-services/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px;padding:24px 28px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface);text-align:right;transition:.3s" style-hover="background:var(--surface-blue);transform:translateY(-4px)"><span style="color:var(--gold);font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase">Next service</span><strong style="color:var(--navy);font-size:18px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.02em">Hearing Aid Services</strong></a>
</div>
</div>
<aside data-sticky="1" style="position:sticky;top:150px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;padding:34px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--navy);color:var(--border-strong)">
<span style="color:var(--gold-light);font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase">Ready for answers?</span>
<h2 style="margin:0;color:var(--white);font-size:29px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.035em;text-wrap:balance">Start with an audiology visit.</h2>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;text-wrap:pretty">Talk with our team about what you have noticed and what may help.</p>
<a href="/book-appointment/" style="margin-top:6px;display:inline-flex;min-height:50px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:12px 26px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--white);color:var(--navy);font-size:14px;font-weight:750;transition:.3s" style-hover="background:var(--brand-red);color:var(--white);transform:translateY(-2px)">Book Your Visit</a>
</div>
</aside>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
